\0
The administrators of an extensive Imperium pure water extraction complex in the Kendrick system allowed Freedom Guard forces to take water from the compound in exchange for a share of the profits. By skimming only a moderate percentage of the facility's output, the scheme went unnoticed by Imperium auditors. However, the Imperium's mole in the Freedom Guard, Stiv Baator, leaked the conspiracy. The directors who had been bribed were abducted and executed, and the water complex was set upon by an Imperium armored division.
\1
The Imperium has discovered our operation, and a large tank fleet has been detected near the complex. A convoy of tanker vessels is orbiting the planet. We cannot hold the facility, but you must defend it long enough to secure another convoy of water. 
\n\n
\cOBJECTIVES\n
\n
-->  Hold off the Imperium assault long enough\n
\s\s\s\s to save 30,000 credits
\2
Your skill is commendable. Continue on.\n
\n
\cHISTORICAL OUTCOME:\n
Unprepared for the fierce Imperium assault, the Freedom Guard defense was overcome by a wave of Tachion Tanks. Realizing they could not hold the complex, the Freedom Guard dispatched a number of suicide bombers to sabotage the facility, but the infantry was torn apart by the entrenched Imperium armor.
\3
Your methods are unsound. You must learn.


